kground\": {\"$input\": [\"characters\", \"小野寺葵\", \"background\"]}, \"how_perceived\": {\"self\": {\"$input\": [\"characters\", \"小野寺葵\", \"how_perceived\", \"self\"]}, \"others\": {\"$input\": [\"characters\", \"小野寺葵\", \"how_perceived\", \"others\"]}, \"瀬川悠真\": {\"$input\": [\"characters\", \"小野寺葵\", \"how_perceived\", \"瀬川悠真\"]}, \"水瀬莉緒\": {\"$input\": [\"characters\", \"小野寺葵\", \"how_perceived\", \"水瀬莉緒\"]}}}, \"水瀬莉緒\": {\"background\": {\"$input\": [\"characters\", \"水瀬莉緒\", \"background\"]}, \"how_perceived\": {\"self\": {\"$input\": [\"characters\", \"水瀬莉緒\", \"how_perceived\", \"self\"]}, \"others\": {\"$input\": [\"characters\", \"水瀬莉緒\", \"how_perceived\", \"others\"]}, \"瀬川悠真\": {\"$input\": [\"characters\", \"水瀬莉緒\", \"how_perceived\", \"瀬川悠真\"]}, \"小野寺葵\": {\"$input\": [\"characters\", \"水瀬莉緒\", \"how_perceived\", \"小野寺葵\"]}}}}}, \"scene\": {\"synopsis\": \"帰り道、悠真の様子がいつもと違うことに気づいた葵が、彼に理由を尋ね、莉緒から告白されたことを聞き出す。\", \"turn_budget\": 10, \"time_point\": \"夕暮れ\", \"location\": \"通学路\", \"turns\": []}, \"scope\": {\"assigned_events\": [{\"id\": 2, \"event\": {\"$input\": [\"milestones\", 2]}}], \"completed_events\": [{\"id\": 0, \"event\": {\"$input\": [\"milestones\", 0]}}, {\"id\": 1, \"event\": {\"$input\": [\"milestones\", 1]}}], \"future_events\": [{\"id\": 3, \"event\": {\"$input\": [\"milestones\", 3]}}, {\"id\": 4, \"event\": \"悠真は葵の告白に対し、自分も昔から葵が好きだったと明言する。\"}, {\"id\": 5, \"event\": {\"$input\": [\"milestones\", 5]}}]}, \"continuity_summary\": \"放課後の教室、悠真と葵が幼馴染として親密な様子を見せていた後、転校生の莉緒が悠真を呼び出した。莉緒は二人きりになれる場所へ彼を誘い、転校初日に困っていた自分を自然に助けてくれた悠真の姿に一目惚れしたことを告白した。莉緒は真剣な表情で彼に付き合ってほしいと申し込んだが、悠真はあまりの急展開に驚き、返事を出せずに立ち尽くしている。\"}"}], "temperature": 0.7, "max_tokens": 16384, "response_format": {"type": "json_schema", "json_schema": {"name": "story_stage", "strict": true, "schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"turns": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "object", "properties": {"speaker": {"enum": ["narrator", "瀬川悠真", "小野寺葵", "水瀬莉緒", null]}, "speech": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "thought": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "narration": {"type": ["string", "null"]}}, "required": ["speaker", "speech", "thought", "narration"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "continuity_summary": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 1000}, "visibility": {"type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": {"type": "object", "properties": {"witnesses": {"type": "array", "items": {"enum": ["瀬川悠真", "小野寺葵", "水瀬莉緒"]}}, "observation": {"type": ["string", "null"]}}, "required": ["witnesses", "observation"], "additionalProperties": false}}, "knowledge_updates": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "properties": {"turn": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0}, "actor": {"enum": ["瀬川悠真", "小野寺葵", "水瀬莉緒"]}, "subject": {"enum": ["瀬川悠真", "小野寺葵", "水瀬莉緒"]}, "fact": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["turn", "actor", "subject", "fact"], "additionalProperties": false}}}, "required": ["turns", "continuity_summary", "visibility", "knowledge_updates"], "additionalProperties": false}}}, "stream": false}}
{"time": "2026-10-26T17:51:34.578+00:00", "event": "http_response", "path": "/chat/completions", "body": "{\"choices\": [{\"finish_reason\": \"stop\", \"index\": 0, \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"{\\\"turns\\\": [{\\\"speaker\\\": null, \\\"speech\\\": null, \\\"thought\\\": null, \\\"narration\\\": \\\"夕暮れ時、オレンジ色の光が通学路を長く照らしている。二人の足音だけが規則正しく響いていた。\\\"}, {\\\"speaker\\\": \\\"小野寺葵\\\", \\\"speech\\\": \\\"ねえ、悠真。さっきからずっと黙ってるけど、どうかしたの？\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"心配\\\", \\\"narration\\\": \\\"葵が悠真の顔を覗き込む。\\\"}, {\\\"speaker\\\": \\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"speech\\\": \\\"えっ、あ、いや……別に。なんでもないよ\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"困惑\\\", \\\"narration\\\": \\\"悠真が目を逸らし、視線を泳がせる。\\\"}, {\\\"speaker\\\": \\\"小野寺葵\\\", \\\"speech\\\": \\\"嘘。顔がすごく硬いし、さっきから視線も泳いでる。何かあったんでしょ？\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"疑念\\\", \\\"narration\\\": \\\"葵が悠真の様子をじっと観察する。\\\"}, {\\\"speaker\\\": \\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"speech\\\": \\\"……実はさ。さっき、水瀬さんに。付き合ってほしいって言われたんだ\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"申し訳なさ\\\", \\\"narration\\\": \\\"悠真が立ち止まり、俯く。\\\"}, {\\\"speaker\\\": \\\"小野寺葵\\\", \\\"speech\\\": \\\"へぇ、そうなんだ。水瀬さん、積極的だね\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"動揺\\\", \\\"narration\\\": \\\"葵が無理に作った笑顔を見せる。\\\"}, {\\\"speaker\\\": null, \\\"speech\\\": null, \\\"thought\\\": null, \\\"narration\\\": \\\"葵は努めて明るい声を出したが、胸の奥がぎゅっと締め付けられるような感覚に襲われた。\\\"}, {\\\"speaker\\\": \\\"小野寺葵\\\", \\\"speech\\\": \\\"それで、なんて答えたの？\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"期待と恐怖\\\", \\\"narration\\\": \\\"葵が悠真の返答を待つ。\\\"}, {\\\"speaker\\\": \\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"speech\\\": \\\"答えられなかった。あまりに突然すぎて、ただ、呆然としちゃって……\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"申し訳なさ\\\", \\\"narration\\\": \\\"悠真が困ったように首を振る。\\\"}, {\\\"speaker\\\": null, \\\"speech\\\": null, \\\"thought\\\": null, \\\"narration\\\": \\\"葵は言葉を失った。もし彼に恋人ができたら、自分はもう、この距離感ではいられなくなる。そんな予感が、夕闇とともに忍び寄っていた。\\\"}], \\\"continuity_summary\\\": \\\"放課後の教室、悠真と葵が幼馴染として親密な様子を見せていた後、転校生の莉緒が悠真を呼び出した。莉緒は二人きりになれる場所へ彼を誘い、転校初日に困っていた自分を自然に助けてくれた悠真の姿に一目惚れしたことを告白した。莉緒は真剣な表情で彼に付き合ってほしいと申し込んだが、悠真はあまりの急展開に驚き、返事を出せずに立ち尽くしている。帰り道、葵は悠真の様子がいつもと違うことに気づき、彼から莉緒の告白について聞き出した。悠真が返事を保留していることを知り、葵は表面上は平静を装いつつも、二人の関係が壊れるかもしれないという強い動揺を覚えている。\\\", \\\"visibility\\\": [{\\\"witnesses\\\": [\\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"小野寺葵\\\"], \\\"observation\\\": \\\"夕暮れの通学路を二人が並んで歩いている。\\\"}, {\\\"witnesses\\\": [\\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"小野寺葵\\\"], \\\"observation\\\": \\\"葵が悠真の顔を覗き込む。\\\"}, {\\\"witnesses\\\": [\\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"小野寺葵\\\"], \\\"observation\\\": \\\"悠真が目を逸らし、視線を泳がせる。\\\"}, {\\\"witnesses\\\": [\\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"小野寺葵\\\"], \\\"observation\\\": \\\"葵が悠真の様子をじっと観察する。\\\"}, {\\\"witnesses\\\": [\\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"小野寺葵\\\"], \\\"observation\\\": \\\"悠真が立ち止まり、俯く。\\\"}, {\\\"witnesses\\\": [\\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"小野寺葵\\\"], \\\"observation\\\": \\\"葵が無理に作った笑顔を見せる。\\\"}, {\\\"witnesses\\\": [\\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"小野寺葵\\\"], \\\"observation\\\": \\\"葵が胸元をぎゅっと掴む。\\\"}, {\\\"witnesses\\\": [\\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"小野寺葵\\\"], \\\"observation\\\": \\\"葵が悠真の返答を待つ。\\\"}, {\\\"witnesses\\\": [\\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"小野寺葵\\\"], \\\"observation\\\": \\\"悠真が困ったように首を振る。\\\"}, {\\\"witnesses\\\": [\\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"小野寺葵\\\"], \\\"observation\\\": \\\"二人の間に重苦しい沈黙が流れる。\\\"}], \\\"knowledge_updates\\\": [{\\\"turn\\\": 4, \\\"actor\\\": \\\"小野寺葵\\\", \\\"subject\\\": \\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"fact\\\": \\\"水瀬莉緒が悠真に告白したこと\\\"}, {\\\"turn\\\": 8, \\\"actor\\\": \\\"小野寺葵\\\", \\\"subject\\\": \\\"瀬川悠真\\\", \\\"fact\\\": \\\"悠真が莉緒の告白に対して返事を保留していること\\\"}]}\", \"reasoning_content\": \"The scene takes place on the way home at dusk. Aoi notices Yuma's unusual behavior and asks him about it. Yuma reveals that Rio confessed to him and he hasn't given her an answer yet. Aoi pretends to be calm but feels a strong sense of agitation/jealousy, realizing that if Yuma gets a girlfriend, their current distance as childhood friends will change.\\n\\n    *   Yuma: Distracted, silent, maybe looking down.\\n    *   Aoi: Observant, noticing the silence, initially casual but then sensing something is wrong.\\n    *   Location: Sunset, walking home.\\n\\n    *   Turn 1: Narration. Setting the scene. Sunset, the orange glow, the silence between them as they walk.\\n    *   Turn 2: Aoi speaks. \\\"Are you okay? You've been quiet.\\\"\\n    *   Turn 3: Yuma's reaction. Hesitant, maybe rubbing his neck.\\n    *   Turn 4: Aoi pushes a bit more. \\\"Did something happen?\\\"\\n    *   Turn 5: Yuma admits it. \\\"Rio... she confessed to me. I don't know what to say.\\\"\\n    *   Turn 6: Aoi's outward reaction. \\\"Oh, really? That's a surprise.\\\" (Pretending to be fine).\\n    *   Turn 7: Narration. Aoi's internal feeling. The realization hits her. The distance feels fragile.\\n    *   Turn 8: Aoi's question. \\\"What did you say?\\\"\\n    *   Turn 9: Yuma. \\\"I couldn't answer. I just stood there.\\\"\\n    *   Turn 10: Final narration. The heavy atmosphere as they walk in silence.\\n\\n    *   `turns`:\\n        1.  Narration: Sunset, orange light, the sound of footsteps.\\n        2.  Aoi: \\\"Hey, Yuma. You've been quiet for a while. Is something wrong?\\\" (Thought: He's acting strange.)\\n        3.  Yuma: \\\"Ah, no, it's nothing...\\\" (Thought: How do I say this?)\\n        4.  Aoi: \\\"Liar. You're walking like you're in a trance.\\\" (Thought: Something definitely happened.)\\n        5.  Yuma: \\\"Actually... Rio... she told me she likes me. And asked me to date her.\\\" (Thought: It's too sudden.)\\n        6.  Aoi: \\\"Oh. I see. She's pretty direct, isn't she?\\\" (Thought: My heart is sinking.)\\n        7.  Narration: Aoi forced a smile, but her hands were trembling slightly.\\n        8.  Aoi: \\\"So, what did you tell her?\\\" (Thought: Please say no.)\\n        9.  Yuma: \\\"I couldn't answer. I was just... stunned.\\\" (Thought: I'm sorry, Aoi.)\\n        10. Narration: The orange sky felt cold. Aoi realized that the natural distance between them might soon be gone.\\n\\n    *   `continuity_summary`: Update with the new fact that Rio confessed and Yuma hasn't answered, and Aoi is feeling agitated.\\n    *   `visibility`: Aoi and Yuma are walking together.