pare initial budget, turning points, causal weight, and room for dialogue/emotion\\\".\\n    *   Old budget was 20, current total is 10.\\n    *   The item is a pivotal moment (turning point).\\n    *   It requires dialogue and emotion.\\n    *   Allocation: 10 (matches total).\\n\\n    *   `{\\\"budgets\\\":[10],\\\"reasons\\\":[\\\"関係性の宣言という物語の転換点であり、独占欲や照れといった感情表現と台詞の描写に十分な予算を割り当てる必要があるため。\\\"]}`\\n\\n    *   `items` order: 1 item.\\n    *   `budgets` length: 1.\\n    *   `budgets[0]` (10) >= `minimum` (1).\\n    *   Sum (10) == `total` (10).\\n    *   Language: Japanese.\\n    *   No code fences/explanation.\\n\\n    *   Item 0: `budgets[0] = 10`.\\n    *   Reason: \\\"関係の宣言という重要な転換点であり、感情の機微と台詞の重みを表現するために最大予算を割り当てる。\\\"\\n\\n    Wait, let's look closer at the input.\\n    `total`: 10\\n    `items`: 1 item.\\n    `old_budget`: 20.\\n    `actual_turns`: 5.\\n\\n    The total is 10. The only item must be 10.\\n\\n    Reasoning:\\n    This is a declaration of love/status. It is a high-weight event. It needs space for the dialogue and the shift in dynamic.\\n\\n    Final Polish:\\n    `{\\\"budgets\\\":[10],\\\"reasons\\\":[\\\"関係を公言する重要な転換点であり、独占欲や照れといった繊細な感情描写と台詞の響きを重視するため。\\\"]}`\"}}], \"created\": 1793037333, \"model\": \"../models/llm/Melody1437-26B-A4B.i1-Q4_K_M.gguf\", \"system_fingerprint\": \"b11852-7894e8b92\", \"object\": \"chat.completion\", \"usage\": {\"completion_tokens\": 909, \"prompt_tokens\": 302, \"total_tokens\": 1211, \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\"cached_tokens\": 170}}, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-NQcYtyWZXFNApSdYqBhIRCevt9V2jt72\", \"timings\": {\"cache_n\": 170, \"prompt_n\": 132, \"prompt_ms\": 87.066, \"prompt_per_token_ms\": 0.6595909090909091, \"prompt_per_second\": 1516.0912411274205, \"predicted_n\": 909, \"predicted_ms\": 5380.397, \"predicted_per_token_ms\": 5.925547356828194, \"predicted_per_second\": 168.76078103530278}}"}
