s I need to expand the 6 turns into 15 turns.\\n    *   Characters:\\n        *   瀬川悠真 (Yuma): Loves Aoi for a long time, doesn't realize Rio's feelings.\\n        *   小野寺葵 (Aoi): Loves Yuma but thought it was just friendship. Now realizes it's love because of Rio's confession.\\n        *   水瀬莉緒 (Rio): Loves Yuma (already confessed in event 1, but not present in this scene).\\n\\n    *   Location: Quiet road at sunset.\\n    *   Event 3: Aoi confesses.\\n    *   Goal: Expand the 6 turns to 15 turns.\\n\\n    *   *Draft Flow:*\\n        1. Narration (Sunset, walking).\\n        2. Aoi stops, mentions Rio's confession, says she's scared.\\n        3. Aoi says it's not just friendship, she loves him.\\n        4. Aoi says she doesn't want him to be someone else's boyfriend.\\n        5. Aoi asks to be his girlfriend, grabs his sleeve.\\n        6. Yuma is stunned.\\n\\n    *   *Expansion Strategy (to reach 15 turns):*\\n        1. Narration: Atmosphere of sunset, the sound of footsteps.\\n        2. Narration: The silence between them, the tension.\\n        3. Aoi: Stops walking, looking down.\\n        4. Aoi: Brings up Rio's confession and her fear.\\n        5. Aoi: Reflects on how she thought they were just friends.\\n        6. Aoi: Admits her feelings (I love you).\\n        7. Narration: Her trembling voice, the orange light hitting her face.\\n        8. Aoi: Expresses jealousy/fear of losing him.\\n        9. Aoi: Refuses to be just a childhood friend anymore.\\n        10. Aoi: Makes the direct request to be his girlfriend.\\n        11. Narration: She grabs his sleeve tightly.\\n        12. Yuma: Reacts, stunned silence, processing the words.\\n        13. Yuma: Stammers, unable to believe it's real.\\n        14. Narration: Their eyes meet, the distance between them shrinking.\\n        15. Yuma: Finally speaks, heart racing.\\n\\n    *   *Turn 1:* Narration. Sunset, footsteps.\\n    *   *Turn 2:* Narration. Tension in the air.\\n    *   *Turn 3:* Aoi. \\\"Hey, Yuma...\\\" (Stops walking).\\n    *   *Turn 4:* Aoi. \\\"About what happened earlier... hearing about Rio-chan made me so scared.\\\"\\n    *   *Turn 5:* Aoi. \\\"I thought I was just being a good childhood friend, but...\\\"\\n    *   *Turn 6:* Aoi. \\\"I realized it's not just friendship. I love you, Yuma.\\\"\\n    *   *Turn 7:* Narration. She looks up, eyes glistening with tears.\\n    *   *Turn 8:* Aoi. \\\"I thought being next to you was just something we'd always do.\\\"\\n    *   *Turn 9:* Aoi. \\\"But the thought of you becoming someone else's boyfriend... I hate it.\\\"\\n    *   *Turn 10:* Aoi. \\\"I don't want things to be ambiguous anymore.\\\"\\n    *   *Turn 11:* Aoi. \\\"Don't just be my childhood friend. I want to be your girlfriend. Please.\\\"\\n    *   *Turn 12:* Narration. She grabs his sleeve tightly.\\n    *   *Turn 13:* Yuma. Stunned. \\\"Aoi... what... are you serious?\\\"\\n    *   *Turn 14:* Yuma. \\\"I... I can't believe this is happening.\\\"\\n    *   *Turn 15:* Narration. The sun dips lower, bathing them in gold.\\n\\n    Wait, let's refine the turns to ensure they are high quality and strictly follow the narrator's style.\\n\\n    *Turn 1 (Narration):* 夕暮れの色が、静かな帰り道をオレンジ色に染めている。二人の足音だけが、規則正しく響いていた。\\n    *Turn 2 (Narration):* 普段通りの帰り道。しかし、二人の間に流れる空気は、どこか重く、張り詰めている。\\n    *Turn 3 (Aoi):* 「ねえ、悠真。さっきの話だけど……」\\n    *Turn 4 (Aoi):* 「莉緒ちゃんに告白されたって聞いて、私、すごく怖くなったんだ。」\\n    *Turn 5 (Aoi):* 「今まで、何でも言い合える幼馴染だから、こうして一緒にいるのが当たり前だと思ってた。」\\n    *Turn 6 (Aoi):* 「でも、違うんだ。私が感じていたのは、ただの幼馴染としての親愛じゃない。」\\n    *Turn 7 (Aoi):* 「……私、悠真のことが好きだよ。」\\n    *Turn 8 (Narration):* 葵は立ち止まり、俯いたまま言葉を絞り出す。震える肩が、彼女の動揺を物語っている。\\n    *Turn 9 (Aoi):* 「ずっと隣にいるのが当然だと思ってた。でも、誰か他の女の子の恋人になるなんて、絶対に嫌。」\\n    *Turn 10 (Aoi):* 「これ以上、曖昧な関係のままなのは、もう耐えられないの。」\\n    *Turn 11 (Aoi):* 「幼馴染としてじゃなくて、恋人として、私と付き合ってほしい。お願い。」\\n    *Turn 12 (Narration):* 彼女は悠真の服の裾を、壊れ物を扱うかのように、けれど離さないという意志を込めてぎゅっと握りしめた。\\n    *Turn 13 (Yuma):* 「葵……。え、あ、いや、本当に……？」\\n    *Turn 14 (Yuma):* 「冗談じゃないよね？ 夢を見てる