ch \\\"「莉緒さんに告白されて、やっと気づいたんだ。俺がずっと隠してきた気持ちに」\\\", Thought null, Narration null\\n    7. Yuma (Speech): Speaker \\\"瀬川悠真\\\", Speech \\\"「俺も、ずっと前から葵が好きだった。幼馴染としてじゃなくて、一人の女の子として」\\\", Thought \\\"決意\\\", Narration null\\n    8. Yuma (Narration): Speaker \\\"瀬川悠真\\\", Speech null, Thought null, Narration \\\"悠真は意を決して、葵の手をそっと握る。\\\"\\n    9. Yuma (Speech): Speaker \\\"瀬川悠真\\\", Speech \\\"「ずっと言えなかったけど、本当は葵のことが、ずっと特別だったんだ」\\\", Thought \\\"安堵\\\", Narration null\\n    10. Aoi (Speech): Speaker \\\"小野寺葵\\\", Speech \\\"「……えっ」\\\", Thought \\\"驚き\\\", Narration null\\n    11. Aoi (Thought): Speaker \\\"小野寺葵\\\", Speech null, Thought \\\"驚き\\\", Narration \\\"葵は目を見開き、握られた手の温もりに肩を震わせる。\\\"\\n    12. Yuma (Speech): Speaker \\\"瀬川悠真\\\", Speech \\\"「だから……俺と、付き合ってくれないかな？」\\\", Thought \\\"期待\\\", Narration null\\n    13. Yuma (Thought): Speaker \\\"瀬川悠真\\\", Speech null, Thought \\\"期待\\\", Narration \\\"悠真は真っ直ぐに葵の瞳を見つめて問いかける。\\\"\\n    14. Aoi (Speech): Speaker \\\"小野寺葵\\\", Speech \\\"「……うん、もちろん。……やっと言ってくれたね」\\\", Thought \\\"幸福\\\", Narration null\\n    15. Aoi (Narration): Speaker \\\"小野寺葵\\\", Speech null, Thought null, Narration \\\"葵の瞳に涙が浮かび、彼女は悠真の肩に頭を預ける。\\\"\\n    16. Narration (Pure): Speaker null, Speech null, Thought null, Narration \\\"茜色の空の下、二人の距離は幼馴染のそれよりもずっと近く、確かなものへと変わった。\\\"\\n\\n    *Wait, I only have 16 turns here.* I need 20. I will expand the emotional reactions and the physical descriptions into separate turns.\\n\\n    *Plan for 20 turns:*\\n    1. Narration (Pure): Park context.\\n    2. Aoi (Speech): \\\"Did I surprise you?\\\"\\n    3. Aoi (Thought): Nervousness.\\n    4. Aoi (Narration): Looking down/finger fidgeting.\\n    5. Yuma (Speech): \\\"I'm the one surprised.\\\"\\n    6. Yuma (Thought): Tension.\\n    7. Yuma (Narration): Sighing/staring.\\n    8. Yuma (Speech): \\\"Rio's confession made me realize...\\\"\\n    9. Yuma (Speech): \\\"I've loved you for a long time.\\\"\\n    10. Yuma (Thought): Determination.\\n    11. Yuma (Narration): Reaching for her hand.\\n    12. Yuma (Speech): \\\"You've always been special.\\\"\\n    13. Aoi (Speech): \\\"Eh?\\\"\\n    14. Aoi (Thought): Shock.\\n    15. Aoi (Narration): Trembling at the warmth.\\n    16. Yuma (Speech): \\\"Will you go out with me?\\\"\\n    17. Yuma (Thought): Expectation.\\n    18. Aoi (Speech): \\\"Yes, of course.\\\"\\n    19. Aoi (Narration): Leaning on his shoulder/tears.\\n    20. Narration (Pure): Final sunset image.\\n\\n    Let's check the counts.\\n    1. Narration (Pure)\\n    2. Aoi (Speech)\\n    3. Aoi (Thought)\\n    4. Aoi (Narration)\\n    5. Yuma (Speech)\\n    6. Yuma (Thought)\\n    7. Yuma (Narration)\\n    8. Yuma (Speech)\\n    9. Yuma (Speech)\\n    10. Yuma (Thought)\\n    11. Yuma (Narration)\\n    12. Yuma (Speech)\\n    13. Aoi (Speech)\\n    14. Aoi (Thought)\\n    15. Aoi (Narration)\\n    16. Yuma (Speech)\\n    17. Yuma (Thought)\\n    18. Aoi (Speech)\\n    19. Aoi (Narration)\\n    20. Narration (Pure)\\n\\n    Total = 20. Perfect.\\n\\n    *Visibility Mapping:*\\n    1. [Yuma, Aoi] - Dusk park bench.\\n    2. [Aoi] - Aoi speaks.\\n    3. [Aoi] - Aoi thinks.\\n    4. [Aoi] - Aoi fidgets.\\n    5. [Yuma] - Yuma speaks.\\n    6. [Yuma] - Yuma thinks.\\n    7. [Yuma] - Yuma stares.\\n    8. [Yuma] - Yuma mentions Rio.\\n    9. [Yuma] - Yuma admits love.\\n    10. [Yuma] - Yuma decides.\\n    11. [Yuma] - Yuma grabs hand.\\n    12. [Yuma] - Yuma says she is special.\\n    13. [Aoi] - Aoi is shocked.\\n    14. [Aoi] - Aoi is shocked.\\n    15. [Aoi] - Aoi trembles.\\n    16. [Yuma] - Yuma asks.\\n    17. [Yuma] - Yuma hopes.\\n    18. [Aoi] - Aoi says yes.\\n    19. [Aoi] - Aoi leans on him.\\n    20. [Yuma, Aoi] - Two people close together.\\n\\n    *Knowledge Update:*\\n    Turn 9: Actor Aoi, Subject Yuma, Fact: He has loved her as a woman for a long time.\\n\\n    *Continuity Summary:* (Update to include the relationship change)\\n    \\\"放課後の教室で、幼馴染の悠真と葵が親密な時間を過ごしていた。そこへ転校生の莉緒が現れ、悠真に一目惚れしたことを告白。悠真は驚き、返事を保留した。帰り