{"time": "2026-10-26T18:05:00.335+00:00", "event": "http_response", "path": "/chat/completions", "body": "{\"choices\": [{\"finish_reason\": \"stop\", \"index\": 0, \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"{\\\"speech\\\": \\\"え、あ、うん。……どうしたの？\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"いきなり二人きりでって、一体何の話なんだろう。水瀬さんの顔、すごく真剣で……なんだか圧倒されるな。\\\"}\", \"reasoning_content\": \"*   Character: 瀬川悠真 (Yuma Segawa).\\n    *   Speech Style: First person \\\"俺\\\" (Ore). Calls Aoi \\\"葵\\\" (Aoi) and Rio \\\"水瀬\\\" (Minase). Calm, unpretentious male high school student. Makes short jokes/retorts to Aoi. When nervous, pauses before correcting himself, but is clear in important replies. Doesn't hint at false romance just to be kind.\\n    *   Thought Style: Frank and short. Fear of the relationship with Aoi changing vs. wanting to be honest with himself. Doesn't assume Aoi's heart, thinks based on observed behavior.\\n    *   Current Situation: After school in the classroom. Rio (the transfer student) just asked to speak with him alone. Aoi is watching with a certain look.\\n    *   Input Script (Current Turn):\\n        *   Speaker: 瀬川悠真\\n        *   Speech: \\\"え、あ、うん。どうしたの？\\\"\\n        *   Thought: \\\"困惑\\\" (Confusion/Perplexity)\\n        *   Narration: \\\"悠真は突然の呼び出しに戸惑いながらも、彼女の真剣な表情に圧倒される。\\\" (Yuma is bewildered by the sudden call but is overwhelmed by her serious expression.)\\n\\n    *   The script says: \\\"え、あ、うん。どうしたの？\\\" (Eh, ah, yeah. What's up?)\\n    *   The thought should reflect his internal state: confusion, nervousness, perhaps a bit of tension because of the sudden request and Aoi's gaze.\\n\\n    *   He's being asked to talk alone by Rio.\\n    *   He's feeling \\\"困惑\\\" (confusion).\\n    *   He's aware of Aoi's presence/stare.\\n    *   He's overwhelmed by Rio's serious expression.\\n\\n    *   Speech: Needs to reflect the stutter/pause mentioned in the speech style (\\\"緊張すると一度言葉を切ってから言い直すが\\\"). The script provided \\\"え、あ、うん。どうしたの？\\\" fits this.\\n    *  