{"time": "2026-10-26T18:05:44.660+00:00", "event": "http_response", "path": "/chat/completions", "body": "{\"choices\": [{\"finish_reason\": \"stop\", \"index\": 0, \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"{\\\"speech\\\": \\\"瀬川くんのこと、ずっと気になっていたの。\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"心臓の音が聞こえちゃいそう。でも、逃げたりしない。私の気持ち、届いてほしい。\\\"}\", \"reasoning_content\": \"*   Character: 水瀬莉緒 (Mizuse Rio).\\n    *   Speech Style: Bright, frank high school girl. Uses \\\"私\\\" (watashi), calls Yuma \\\"瀬川くん\\\" (Segawa-kun) and Aoi \\\"小野寺さん\\\" (Onodera-san). Expresses feelings directly.\\n    *   Thought Style: Short expressions of expectation/tension. Confident in her feelings but unsure if Yuma reciprocates.\\n    *   Context: After school, classroom. Rio has just confessed that she fell in love with Yuma at first sight and wants to know him more.\\n    *   Current Script (Target Turn):\\n        *   Speaker: 水瀬莉緒\\n        *   Speech: \\\"瀬川くんのこと、ずっと気になっていたの。\\\"\\n        *   Thought: \\\"告白\\\" (Confession)\\n        *   Narration (Not to be output, but for context): Rio takes a step forward, closing the distance.\\n    *   Constraints:\\n        *   Output format: `{\\\"speech\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"...\\\"}`\\n        *   No code fences, no explanations.\\n        *   Maintain facts: Rio is confessing, she's been interested in him.\\n        *   Use character knowledge and past thoughts to inform the inner monologue.\\n\\n    *   Speech: \\\"瀬川くんのこと、ずっと気になっていたの。\\\" (I've been interested in you for a long time, Segawa-kun.)\\n    *   Thought: Needs to reflect the nervousness and the intensity of the moment. She's just finished the long part about how she fell in love and now she's narrowing it down to the core feeling.\\n    *   Past thoughts suggest: \\\"心臓の音が聞こえちゃいそうなくらい緊張する……\\\" (My heart is beating so hard it might be audible...), \\\"震えが止まらない\\\" (Can't stop shaking).\\n    *   Current thought should be a direct reflection of the confession moment.\\n\\