ces.\\n    *   No explanations.\\n\\n    *   Speech: \\\"ねえ、悠真。さっきからずっと黙ってるけど、どうかしたの？\\\"\\n    *   Thought: \\\"さっきから全然喋らないし、なんだか落ち着かない。……もしかして、何か嫌なことでもあったのかな。\\\" (He hasn't spoken for a while, and I'm unsettled. Maybe something bad happened?)\\n\\n    *   Speech style: \\\"悠真\\\" (Check), informal (Check).\\n    *   Thought style: Simple, reflecting the stir in her chest (Check).\\n    *   Current turn: Only the provided script (Check).\\n\\n    *Self-Correction during drafting:* The script says \\\"心配\\\" (Worried). I should expand that to fit her personality and current emotional state (the unease caused by Rio's presence).\\n\\n    *Final JSON Construction:*\\n    `{\\\"speech\\\": \\\"ねえ、悠真。さっきからずっと黙ってるけど、どうかしたの？\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"さっきから全然喋らないし、なんだか落ち着かない。……もしかして、何か嫌なことでもあったのかな。\\\"}`\"}}], \"created\": 1793037990, \"model\": \"../models/llm/Melody1437-26B-A4B.i1-Q4_K_M.gguf\", \"system_fingerprint\": \"b11852-7894e8b92\", \"object\": \"chat.completion\", \"usage\": {\"completion_tokens\": 777, \"prompt_tokens\": 1250, \"total_tokens\": 2027, \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\"cached_tokens\": 215}}, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-eDNaV2NjZKw9NLpjeZHBYSbNP7kJhtz8\", \"timings\": {\"cache_n\": 215, \"prompt_n\": 1035, \"prompt_ms\": 219.73, \"prompt_per_token_ms\": 0.21229951690821255, \"prompt_per_second\": 4710.326309561735, \"predicted_n\": 777, \"predicted_ms\": 5183.839, \"predicted_per_token_ms\": 6.680204896907217, \"predicted_per_second\": 149.69600714837017}}"}
