小野寺葵\", \"speech\": \"……そう。よかったじゃない、素敵なことだもん\"}], \"current_observation\": \"後ろを追う悠真。\"}, \"past_thoughts\": [\"いきなり二人きりでって、一体何の話なんだろう。水瀬さんの顔、すごく真剣で……なんだか圧倒されるな。\", \"……嘘だろ。いきなりそんな……。どうすればいいんだ、これ。\", \"な、何言って……！？ いきなり、そんな……。\", \"嘘だろ……。いきなり、そんな……。どう返せばいいんだよ、これ。\", \"嘘をついてる。でも、こんなこと、今すぐ話せるわけないだろ……\", \"嘘をついてる。でも、こんなこと、今すぐ葵に話せるわけないだろ……。どう言えばいいんだよ、これ。\", \"申し訳ない。隠し事をするつもりはないのに、どうしても言葉がうまく出てこない。\", \"もっと、ちゃんと返事すべきだった。でも、あの時は本当に、何も考えられなくて。葵の前で、情けない姿を見せちゃったな。\"], \"time_point\": \"夕暮れ\", \"location\": \"通学路\", \"reference_material\": {\"current_script\": {\"speaker\": \"瀬川悠真\", \"speech\": \"葵？ なんでそんなに急に歩き出すんだよ\", \"thought\": \"不安\", \"narration\": \"慌てて彼女の背中を追う。\"}, \"future_script\": [{\"speaker\": null, \"speech\": null, \"narration\": \"葵は答えず、逃げるように歩幅を広げる。夕闇が、当たり前だった距離が壊れてしまう予感を連れてきた。\"}]}}"}], "temperature": 0.7, "max_tokens": 16384, "response_format": {"type": "json_schema", "json_schema": {"name": "story_stage", "strict": true, "schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"speech": {"type": ["string", "null"]}, "thought": {"type": ["string", "null"]}}, "required": ["speech", "thought"], "additionalProperties": false}}}, "stream": false}}
{"time": "2026-10-26T18:08:06.290+00:00", "event": "http_response", "path": "/chat/completions", "body": "{\"choices\": [{\"finish_reason\": \"stop\", \"index\": 0, \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"{\\\"speech\\\": \\\"葵？ なんでそんなに急に歩き出すんだよ\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"どうしたんだよ、そんなに急いで。……もしかして、さっきの話、嫌だったのか？ 葵がこんな風に逃げるなんて、なんだか不安になるな。\\\"}\", \"reasoning_content\": \"*   Actor: 瀬川悠真 (Yuma Segawa)\\n    *   Speech Style: \\\"Ore\\\", calls Aoi \\\"Aoi\\\" and Rio \\\"Mizuse\\\". Calm/unpretentious high school boy. Short jokes/light teasing with Aoi. Stutters/pauses when nervous but clear on important answers. Avoids implying romance if not there.\\n    *   Thought Style: Honest, short. Fear of changing relationship with Aoi, wanting to be sincere. Doesn't assume others' hearts.\\n    *   Knowledge:\\n        *   Initial: Ordinary student, likes Aoi, thinks Rio is just trying to make friends.\\n        *   Acquired: Rio fell in love at first sight with him.\\n        *   Witnessed: Aoi asking what's wrong. He told her Rio asked him out. Aoi reacted calmly/positively.\\n        *   Past Thoughts: Overwhelmed by Rio's confession, unable to answer, feeling guilty for hiding it/not being able to speak properly.\\n    *   Current Script (Target):\\n        *   Speaker: 瀬川悠真\\n        *   Speech: \\\"葵？ なんでそんなに急に歩き出すんだよ\\\"\\n        *   Thought: \\\"不安\\\" (Anxious)\\n        *   Narration: \\\"慌てて彼女の背中を追う。\\\" (Chasing her back in a hurry.)\\n\\n    *   Location: 通学路 (Commute route)\\n    *   Time: 夕暮れ (Sunset)\\n    *   Context: Aoi is walking away quickly/running away after the conversation where Yuma revealed Rio's confession. Yuma is chasing her. He feels guilty/anxious.\\n\\n    *   Speech: \\\"葵？ なんでそんなに急に歩き出すんだよ\\\" (Aoi? Why are you suddenly walking so fast?)\\n    *   Tone: Concerned, slightly puzzled, maybe a bit tense because of the previous topic.\\n\\n    *   Thought: Needs to reflect his anxiety and the feeling that something is changing.\\n    