{"time": "2026-10-26T18:11:20.284+00:00", "event": "http_response", "path": "/chat/completions", "body": "{\"choices\": [{\"finish_reason\": \"stop\", \"index\": 0, \"message\": {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"{\\\"speech\\\": \\\"……これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\", \\\"thought\\\": \\\"震える手を隠すように、裾を強く握りしめる。お願い、拒絶しないで。今の言葉、ちゃんと届いてる……？ もう、曖昧なままなのは嫌なの。幼馴染じゃなくて、あなたの特別な人になりたい。\\\"}\", \"reasoning_content\": \"*   Character: 小野寺葵 (Aoi Onodera).\\n    *   Relationship with Yuma: Childhood friends, close, she just confessed her romantic feelings.\\n    *   Current Situation: After confessing, she is confronting him, asking if he still wants to remain just childhood friends despite her feelings.\\n    *   Current Emotion/State: Deeply afraid of losing him, desperate to be more than a friend, currently gripping his clothes (裾/hem of clothes).\\n    *   Speech Style: \\\"Watashi\\\" (I). Casual with Yuma, polite/soft with Rio. Since she realized her love, her jokes stop, and she becomes honest and shy/vulnerable. No shouting or violence to hide embarrassment.\\n    *   Thought Style: Simple monologue about her feelings softening/unfolding. Realizes she wants to be his lover.\\n    *   Input Script:\\n        *   Speech: \\\"……これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\" (Even after this, you're saying you want to stay just childhood friends?)\\n        *   Thought: \\\"これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\" (Same as speech, but should be internal realization/emotion).\\n        *   Narration (for context): \\\"彼女は握った裾をさらに強く引き寄せた。\\\" (She pulled the hem even harder).\\n\\n    *   Aoi has already confessed (\\\"I love you\\\").\\n    *   She knows Yuma was approached by Rio.\\n    *   She is terrified of the \\\"ordinary\\\" being broken.\\n    *   She is currently clinging to him.\\n\\n    *   *Thought*: She's trembling. She just poured her heart out. The silence or his reaction is agonizing. She needs to know if her confession changed anything. She feels the fabric of his clothes between her fingers.\\n    *   *Refining Thought*: \\\"Please don't say you want to stay as just friends. I can't bear it. I've already decided. I want to be your special someone.\\\" (Translating to her style: \\\"お願い、そんな顔しないで。幼馴染のままなんて、もう嫌なの。\\\")\\n\\n    *   *Speech*: \\\"...これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\"\\n    *   *Refining Speech*: The script provides the line. I need to ensure the tone matches her current emotional state. She is vulnerable, perhaps a bit desperate, but not aggressive.\\n\\n    *   Actor: 小野寺葵\\n    *   Speech: \\\"……これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\"\\n    *   Thought: \\\"お願い、否定しないで。今の私の言葉、ちゃんと届いてる？ 幼馴染なんて言葉で、この胸の震えを誤魔化すのは、もう限界なの。\\\" (Please don't deny it. Did my words reach you? I can't hide this trembling in my chest with the word 'childhood friend' anymore.)\\n\\n    *   JSON format only.\\n    *   No code fences or descriptions.\\n    *   Current turn only.\\n\\n    *   *Speech Style Check*: \\\"watashi\\\", casual/emotional.\\n    *   *Thought Style Check*: Simple, focused on the feeling of being a lover.\\n\\n    *Let's refine the thought to be more about her internal state in this moment.*\\n    Thought: \\\"震える手を隠したくて、裾をぎゅっと握りしめる。もしここで拒絶されたら、私はどうなっちゃうんだろう。それでも、言わなきゃいけない。私は、あなたのことが好きなんだから。\\\" (I grip the hem tightly to hide my shaking hands. What will happen to me if I'm rejected here? Even so, I have to say it. Because I love you.)\\n\\n    Wait, the prompt asks to maintain the script's content. The script says:\\n    Speech: \\\"……これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\"\\n    Thought: \\\"これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\"\\n\\n    Actually, the prompt says \\\"役者としてspeechとthoughtの表現だけを変える\\\" (As an actor, change only the expression of speech and thought) while \\\"脚本の重要な事実...を維持し\\\" (maintain important facts). The thought in the reference material is just a repetition of the speech, which is a placeholder. I should expand the thought to reflect her internal monologue as instructed.\\n\\n    *Final Polish*:\\n    Speech: \\\"……これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\"\\n    Thought: \\\"お願い、否定しないで。今の私の言葉、ちゃんと届いてる……？ 幼馴染なんて言葉で、この胸のざわつきを誤魔化すのは、もう限界なの。\\\" (Please don't deny it. Are my words reaching you? I can't hide this restlessness with the word 'childhood friend' anymore.)\\n\\n    *Wait*, looking at the instructions again: \\\"actor.initial_perceptionsは初期の主観。character_knowledgeで後から知った事実を優先する。\\\" and \\\"past_thoughtsは自分だけの思考\\\".\\n    The past thoughts include: \\\"もう、曖昧なままなのは嫌。ただの幼馴染じゃなくて、あなたの特別な人になりたい。\\\"\\n\\n    Let's integrate that.\\n\\n    Speech: \\\"……これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\"\\n    Thought: \\\"お願い、拒絶しないで。今の言葉、ちゃんと伝わってるかな。もう、曖昧なままなのは嫌なの。幼馴染じゃなくて、あなたの特別な人になりたい……。\\\"\\n\\n    Check:\\n    - Speaker: 小野寺葵\\n    - Speech: \\\"……これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\" (Matches script)\\n    - Thought: (Expanded based on character's internal state and past thoughts)\\n\\n    One more check on speech style: \\\"悠真には親しい間柄らしいくだけた口調で、軽口も言う。恋心を自覚すると、いつもの冗談が途切れたり、素直な言葉を口にして照れたりする。\\\"\\n    The speech \\\"……これでも、まだ幼馴染のままがいいって言うの？\\\" is already provided in the script. I will use it exactly.\\n\\n    Final Thought Construction:\\n    \\\"震える手を隠すように、裾を強く握りしめる。お願い、拒絶しないで。今の言葉、ちゃんと届いてる……？ もう、曖昧なままなのは嫌なの。幼馴染じゃなくて、あなたの特別な人になりたい。\\\"\\n\\n    Let's go.\"}}], \"created\": 1793038280, \"model\": \"../models/llm/Melody1437-26B-A4B.i1-Q4_K_M.gguf\", \"system_fingerprint\": \"b11852-7894e8b92\", \"object\": \"chat.completion\", \"usage\": {\"completion_tokens\": 1494, \"prompt_tokens\": 1424, \"total_tokens\": 2918, \"prompt_tokens_details\": {\"cached_tokens\": 215}}, \"id\": \"chatcmpl-g5fUcZU6pzyUHTgqiToSELW8D3autXtD\", \"timings\": {\"cache_n\": 215, \"prompt_n\": 1209, \"prompt_ms\": 257.992, \"prompt_per_token_ms\": 0.21339288668320927, \"prompt_per_second\": 4686.191819901392, \"predicted_n\": 1494, \"predicted_ms\": 10118.097, \"predicted_per_token_ms\": 6.777024112525117, \"predicted_per_second\": 147.55739147391057}}"}
